Open items carried forward (measured this campaign, not
addressed): (1) the discard-side likelihood remains the frontier —
the search's discard behavior is context-dependent (post-pickup:
dw-argmin 100%/tie-break ~uniform; post-draw: dumps drawn junk
over bigger dead cards) and no simple energy/tier model fits; a
measured behavior model of the search is the indicated next step.
(2) Take-scenario particle clouds ~10 dw too optimistic (S5).
(3) Mid-game tau_p=0.1 never calibrated against the search's
actual take-deviation rate.
